			"notes": "LangMod 0.1.0 for **Minecraft 26.1.2** with Fabric.\n\nThe first time you pick up an item, say its name out loud in the language you are learning\n(Mandarin Chinese, Spanish, French, Korean, Russian, Dutch, Latin, Tagalog, Japanese, Bosnian,\nPortuguese, Vietnamese or German). Speech recognition runs on your computer with whisper.cpp;\nnothing is sent anywhere.\n\n**How to install:** follow [INSTALL.md](https://github.com/DylanTopic/MinecraftLanguageMod/blob/HEAD/INSTALL.md). In short, you need:\n\n- Fabric Loader for Minecraft 26.1.2, and Fabric API\n- `langmod-0.1.0.jar` (below, under Assets) in your `mods` folder\n- the Whisper model `ggml-small.bin` in `config/langmod/models`\n- a microphone; to hear names said out loud, Windows 10 or 11 with a voice for your language"
